      "message": "The size of the buffers member variable within the Video class never exceeds ASPEED_VIDEO_V4L2_MIN_BUF_REQ (defined with a value of 3), so the corresponding code path is unlikely to throw exceptions.\n\nPer the official documentation for https://en.cppreference.com/cpp/container/vector/resize: when resizing a vector to a smaller size, its capacity will not shrink. This design avoids invalidating all iterators; the standard only invalidates iterators pointing to or following the erased elements.",
